OL,3,GNEWSACouncil split 'worse deal for the
OL,4,Anorth of county'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create two new unitary
OL,7,Fcouncils in Worcestershire would
OL,8,Fdisadvantage the north of the county
OL,9,Fwhen compared to the south - with
OL,10,Fgreater pressures on its services,
OL,11,Fhigher needs from the public and less
OL,12,Fcouncil tax to pay for it.
OL,14,FThat is according to a letter from the
OL,15,Fgovernment, which also admitted having
OL,16,Fone larger council for the whole of
OL,17,FWorcestershire offered a "stronger
OL,18,Foverall" financial case.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
