OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil split 'worse deal for the
OL,4,Anorth of county'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes just days after ministers
OL,7,Fagreed to progress plans for a
OL,8,Fnorth-south split, which is expected to
OL,9,Fgo ahead in 2029.
OL,11,FIt has led to some councillors calling
OL,12,Ffor major services like highways and
OL,13,Fsocial care to be shared, if the
OL,14,Ftwo-authority solution is finalised.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
